{"id": "q0062", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 321549282, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "Dexter has five pigs. Each one eats 4 pounds of feed, twice a day. If Dexter ordered 300 pounds of feed, how many pounds of feed is left after a week?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0062.wav", "input_sha256": "5a3a06aa57496346a4242089421ae2f546556db35ea4f183e556151d4c41bf8f", "input_samples": 211400, "input_s": 13.213, "n_real_chunks": 14, "score": 0.0906, "act": 0.999, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "Each pig eats 4 pounds of feed twice a day, so each pig eat s 8 pounds a day. D exter has five pig s, so the total daily consumption is 5 pigs times 8 pounds per pig, which equals 40 pounds a day. In a week, that amounts to 4 0 pounds a day times 7 days, equal ing 2 80 pounds. If Dexter ordered 300 pounds of feed, then after a week, the remaining feed would be 3 00 minus 2 80, which leaves 20 pounds left.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 13, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 27, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0062_local_local.wav", "sha256": "18753eea872a25e67ca4c19c93c7c727d08bbb5bcf5534403cc914ec1d3b5837", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 27.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.057, 1.102, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.058, 2.102, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.058, 3.102, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.