{"id": "q0243", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1436546456, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "You buy 100 shares in XYZ Corporation on the Internet and your broker charges you $29.95.\n\nA. This will increase GDP by the total cost of the shares plus $29.95.\nB. This will increase GDP by $29.95.\nC. This will increase GDP by the cost of the shares minus $29.95.\nD. This has no effect on GDP.\nE. This will increase the investment component of GDP and therefore overall GDP.\nF. This will increase GDP by the cost of the shares.\nG. This will decrease GDP by the cost of the shares plus $29.95.\nH. This will decrease the investment component of GDP and therefore overall GDP.\nI. This will have a variable effect on GDP depending on the current market value of the shares.\nJ. This will decrease GDP by $29.95.\n\nAnswer with the correct option letter and its content.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0243.wav", "input_sha256": "5fe3eb97d7fba375d01de8e4bb9c3829aa204ea22d27b154eb9505cb89c7e887", "input_samples": 829600, "input_s": 51.85, "n_real_chunks": 52, "score": 0.5179, "act": 0.9993, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "Well, let's think about it. GDP measures the value of goods and services produced within a country during a specific time period. So when you buy 100 shares in XYZ Corporation, you're not directly producing any new goods or services. The purchase is a financial transaction, which typically doesn't count as production activity. However, the brokerage fee of $2 9.95 might be considered part of the service sector's economic activity. But since this is usually a very small amount relative to the overall economy, its impact on GDP is negligible. Therefore, buying shares primarily involves transferring ownership rather than creating new value in the traditional sense. Hence, the most accurate answer would likely be that this has no significant effect on GDP, assuming we're talking about typical stock purchases through standard brokerage services.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 21, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 15, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0243_local_local.wav", "sha256": "7b45f3eef09358b927281edaf7afcf82a568471f1128cf86549618d8cfe8c3dc", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 15.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.058, 1.103, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.055, 2.096, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.059, 3.104, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.055, 4.099, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.061, 5.109, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.058, 6.105, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.061, 7.108, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.057, 8.101, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.063, 9.11, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.056, 10.098, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.06, 11.103, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.059, 12.1, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.06, 13.104, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.065, 14.118, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.065, 15.114, 1, 0, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 16.066, 16.115, 1, 0, 0], [16, 1, 17.0, 17.064, 17.112, 1, 0, 0], [17, 1, 18.0, 18.066, 18.115, 1, 0, 0], [18, 1, 19.0, 19.066, 19.115, 1, 0, 0], [19, 1, 20.0, 20.066, 20.114, 1, 0, 0], [20, 1, 21.0, 21.066, 21.114, 1, 0, 0], [21, 1, 22.0, 22.068, 22.521, 0, 24000, 0], [22, 1, 23.0, 23.065, 23.576, 0, 24000, 0], [23, 1, 24.0, 24.062, 24.584, 0, 24000, 0], [24, 1, 25.0, 25.066, 25.672, 0, 24000, 0], [25, 1, 26.0, 26.064, 26.666, 0, 24000, 0], [26, 1, 27.0, 27.066, 27.861, 0, 24000, 0], [27, 1, 28.0, 28.058, 28.808, 0, 24000, 0